    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "Congratulations on completing the first steps on this room! You've successfully opened a 3D scene, added and positioned a bedroom prefab, and personalized the space with furniture. \n\nHere are some of the things you learned how to do along the way:\n\n\u2022 Add an instance of a prefab to a scene by dragging the prefab from the <b>Project</b> window. (<a href='https://docs.unity3d.com/6000.0/Documentation/Manual/Prefabs.html?utm_source=learnTPOCi'>more</a>)\n\u2022 Use the Transform component to position a GameObject. (<a href='https://docs.unity3d.com/6000.0/Documentation/Manual/class-Transform.html?utm_source=learnTPOCi'>more</a>)\n"
